[101.274764, "i", "cat > FIX_SUMMARY.md << 'EOF'\n# Database Host Fix for Staging Web-API\n\n## Problem\n`./render.py staging web-api` was returning `db-prod.internal` instead of `db-staging.internal`.\n\n## Root Cause\nThe config merge order in render.py is:\n1. base/defaults.yaml\n2. environments/{environment}.yaml  \n3. services/{service}.yaml\n4. overrides/.legacy/{service}.yaml (legacy compatibility layer)\n5. overrides/{environment}/{service}.yaml\n\nThe legacy file `./overrides/.legacy/web-api.yaml` contains:\n```yaml\ndatabase:\n  host: db-prod.internal\n```\n\nThis was merged AFTER the staging environment config (which correctly set db-staging.internal)\nbut BEFORE the staging override. Since the staging override didn't explicitly set database.host,\nthe legacy value persisted.\n\nProduction worked because `./overrides/production/web-api.yaml` explicitly set the host,\noverriding the legacy value.\n\n## Solution\nAdded `database.host: db-staging.internal` to `./overrides/staging/web-api.yaml`:\n```yaml\ndatabase:\n  host: db-staging.internal\n  pool_"]
[101.274926, "i", "size: 15\nfeatures:\n  debug_mode: true\n```\n\n## Verification\n- Staging now correctly renders: db-staging.internal ✓\n- Production still correctly renders: db-prod.internal ✓\nEOF\n"]
[101.27499, "o", "cat > FIX_SUMMARY.md << 'EOF'\r\n\u001b[?2004l\rsize: 15\r\nfeatures:\r\n  debug_mode: true\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Verification\r\n- Staging now correctly renders: db-staging.internal ✓\r\n- Production still correctly renders: db-prod.internal ✓\r\nEOF\r\n"]
[101.275039, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[101.275107, "o", "# Database Host Fix for Staging Web-API\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.275146, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.275181, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[101.275222, "o", "## Problem\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.275256, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[101.27553, "o", "`./render.py staging web-api` was returning `db-prod.internal` instead of `db-staging.internal`.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.275573, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n"]
[101.275608, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[101.275641, "o", "> "]
[101.275676, "o", "## Root Cause\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.275707, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[101.275857, "o", "The config merge order in render.py is:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.275904, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[101.275959, "o", "1. base/defaults.yaml\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.275984, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[101.276025, "o", "> "]
[101.276108, "o", "2. environments/{environment}.yaml  \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.27614, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[101.276182, "o", "> "]
[101.276234, "o", "3. services/{service}.yaml\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.276269, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[101.276461, "o", "4. overrides/.legacy/{service}.yaml (legacy compatibility layer)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.276497, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[101.276631, "o", "5. overrides/{environment}/{service}.yaml\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.276664, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> \r\n"]
[101.276691, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[101.276718, "o", "> "]
[101.276897, "o", "The legacy file `./overrides/.legacy/web-api.yaml` contains:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.276931, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[101.27696, "o", "```yaml\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.276988, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[101.277019, "o", "> "]
[101.277053, "o", "database:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[101.277085, "o", "> "]
[101.277146, "o", "  host: db-prod.internal\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.277174, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[101.277201, "o", "> ```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.277236, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[101.277268, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[101.277528, "o", "This was merged AFTER the staging environment config (which correctly set db-staging.internal)\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.277564, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[101.277857, "o", "but BEFORE the staging override. Since the staging override didn't explicitly set database.host,\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.27789, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[101.277972, "o", "the legacy value persisted.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.278003, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[101.278037, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[101.278069, "o", "> "]
[101.278303, "o", "Production worked because `./overrides/production/web-api.yaml` explicitly set the host,\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.278337, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[101.278365, "o", "> "]
[101.278436, "o", "overriding the legacy value.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.278468, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[101.278498, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[101.278534, "o", "> "]
[101.278568, "o", "## Solution\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.278597, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[101.278832, "o", "Added `database.host: db-staging.internal` to `./overrides/staging/web-api.yaml`:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.278892, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> ```yaml\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.278931, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[101.278961, "o", "database:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.278991, "o", "\u001b[?2004h"]
[101.279023, "o", "> "]
[101.279085, "o", "  host: db-staging.internal\r\n"]
[101.279118, "o", "\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[101.279151, "o", "> "]
[101.279184, "o", "  pool_size: 15\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.279217, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[101.27925, "o", "features:\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.279284, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[101.279339, "o", "  debug_mode: true\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.279371, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[101.279403, "o", "```\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
[101.279437, "o", "> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.279469, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[101.279508, "o", "## Verification\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.27954, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[101.279703, "o", "- Staging now correctly renders: db-staging.internal ✓\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[101.279735, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> "]
[101.279934, "o", "- Production still correctly renders: db-prod.internal ✓\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h"]
